@OrderApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5191

### 1. Criar pedido com pagamento aprovado (Fluxo Feliz da Saga)
POST {{OrderApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Lucas Conte",
  "paymentMethod": "pix",
  "simulatePaymentFailure": false,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "6af7983c92614215520ddef9",
      "productName": "Ryzen 7 5700X",
      "category": "cpu",
      "unitPrice": 1290.00,
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "productId": "6af7983c92614215520ddef8",
      "productName": "RTX 5070",
      "category": "gpu",
      "unitPrice": 4890.00,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 2. Criar pedido simulando recusa do cartão (Aciona Transação Compensatória / Rollback de Estoque)
POST {{OrderApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Lucas Conte",
  "paymentMethod": "card",
  "simulatePaymentFailure": true,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "6af7983c92614215520ddef8",
      "productName": "RTX 5070",
      "category": "gpu",
      "unitPrice": 4890.00,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}
